license: MIT
version: 0.1.0
date-released: "2026-11-28"
repository-code: "https://github.com/Max0Past/early-entropy-budget-exhaustion"
abstract: >-
  Decode loop, per-step signal computation and analysis scripts for a study of whether
  early entropy warns of token-budget exhaustion in chain-of-thought decoding. Entropy is
  read from the raw logits at a fixed reference temperature, so that readings are
  comparable across sampling temperatures; the scripts reproduce every number and figure
  of the preprint from the released trajectories.
keywords:
  - chain-of-thought reasoning
  - adaptive decoding
  - predictive entropy
  - repetition loops
  - token budget
